# Frantic Scapegoat: "Whenever one or more other creatures you control enter, if this creature is suspected, you may suspect one of
# the other creatures. If you do, this creature is no longer suspected" (CR 603.4, 701.60a). Bot1's suspected Scapegoat, then a
# Memnite enters: Bot1 accepts, the Memnite is suspected and the Scapegoat is not (it loses menace and can't block). The condition
# is the Scapegoat being suspected: with it no longer suspected, Bot1's Ornithopter next asks nothing and is not suspected.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Frantic Scapegoat
Memnite
Ornithopter
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Frantic Scapegoat.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Frantic Scapegoat.Suspected = true
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Suspected = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Frantic Scapegoat.Suspected = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Frantic Scapegoat.Keywords = Haste
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Suspected = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Suspected = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Frantic Scapegoat.Suspected = (absent)
